1987 and 1995/97</article-title><source>J Epidemiol Community Health</source><year>2002</year><volume>56</volume><fpage>457</fpage><lpage>460</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12011205</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1136/jech.56.6.457</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wardle</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Waller</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Jarvis</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Sex differences in the association of socioeconomic status with obesity</article-title><source>Am J Public Health</source><year>2002</year><volume>92</volume><fpage>1299</fpage><lpage>1304</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12144988</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.2105/AJPH.92.8.1299</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dallongeville</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Bringer</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Bruckert</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Charbonnel</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Dievart</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Komajda</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><etal></etal></person-group><article-title>Abdominal obesity is associated with ineffective control of cardiovascular risk factors in primary care in France</article-title><source>Diabetes Metab</source><year>2008</year><volume>34</volume><fpage>606</fpage><lpage>611</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19019717</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.diabet.2008.07.001</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Zalesin</surname><given-names>KC</given-names></name><name><surname>Franklin</surname><given-names>